{% doc %}
  @prompt
    请在我的 Shopify 产品系列模板里，新增一个 42 Standard Color Options 色卡说明区块，用于介绍 Metal Aluminum Fan Staves & Hardware Kits 的颜色选择。
    
    区块位置放在：
    
    Hardware Kit Included 下方，Why Choose Aluminum Staves 上方。
    
    这个区块不要做得太复杂，也不要占用太多页面高度。整体风格要和页面一致：premium / elegant / clean / stage craft，适合移动端浏览。
    
    区块结构
    
    请使用：
    
    Rich Text + Image
    
    如果模板不支持这种组合，请使用：
    
    Rich Text 区块
    Image 区块
    分开上下排列。
    Rich Text 内容
    
    Heading / 标题：
    
    42 Standard Color Options
    
    Text / 正文：
    
    Choose from 42 standard colors for your aluminum fan staves. Match your feather color, costume design, or stage performance theme. Custom color requests are also welcome.
    
    Small note / 小提示：
    
    Colors may vary slightly due to screen settings, lighting, and the powder-coated finish.
    
    Image / 图片
    
    请在文字下面放一张完整的 42 色色卡图。
    
    图片不要铺得太高，桌面端建议中等宽度显示，手机端自动适配全宽。
    
    Image Alt Text：
    
    42 standard color options for metal aluminum fan staves
    
    设计要求
    标题使用 H2
    背景使用白色或浅色
    文字居中或左对齐都可以，但整体要干净高级
    图片不要过大，不要压住页面
    桌面端保持适中宽度
    手机端图片清晰可读
    Padding 使用中等，不要太大
    不要添加产品列表
    不要添加复杂按钮
    不要使用视频
    不要让这个区块比 Hero Banner 更抢眼
    重点表达：42 colors available + custom colors welcome
    如果可以添加按钮
    
    如果模板支持按钮，可以加一个小按钮：
    
    Button Text:
    View Color Chart
    
    但如果没有单独色卡页面，可以不加按钮。
    
    最终目标
    
    这个区块的作用是让客户快速知道：
    我们的 aluminum fan staves 有 42 standard colors，可以搭配羽毛、服装和舞台主题，也可以联系我们定制颜色。
    
    请生成一个简洁、高级、适合 Shopify Collection 页面使用的色卡说明区块。
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-color-chart-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-color-chart-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-color-chart-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.heading_spacing }}px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .ai-color-chart-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.text_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-color-chart-note-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.note_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.note_color }};
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.note_spacing }}px;
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .ai-color-chart-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.image_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-color-chart-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-color-chart-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-color-chart-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    max-height: 300px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-color-chart-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 8px 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-color-chart-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.button_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-color-chart-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 12px 28px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_text_size }}px;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.button_uppercase }};
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .ai-color-chart-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-color-chart-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top | times: 0.7 }}px 16px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-color-chart-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.85 }}px;
    }

    .ai-color-chart-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.text_size | times: 0.95 }}px;
    }

    .ai-color-chart-note-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.note_size | times: 0.95 }}px;
    }

    .ai-color-chart-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-color-chart-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-color-chart-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-color-chart-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.heading }}
      </h2>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
      <div class="ai-color-chart-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.description }}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.note != blank %}
      <div class="ai-color-chart-note-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.note }}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-color-chart-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.color_chart_image %}
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.color_chart_image | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.color_chart_image.alt | default: '42 standard color options for metal aluminum fan staves' | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.color_chart_image.width }}"
          height="{{ block.settings.color_chart_image.height }}"
          class="ai-color-chart-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
      {% else %}
        <div class="ai-color-chart-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          <div class="ai-color-chart-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            Add your 42-color chart image
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.show_button and block.settings.button_text != blank %}
      <div class="ai-color-chart-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.button_link != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}" class="ai-color-chart-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.button_text }}
          </a>
        {% else %}
          <span class="ai-color-chart-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="cursor: default;">
            {{ block.settings.button_text }}
          </span>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

